= Bernie Sanders

Sanders is the standard-bearer of the Socialist wing, though one of its less radical members. He serves technically as an independent Senator, but is a member of the Progressive Caucus and holds influence in the Party.

- @grassroots
- @reconciliation
- @mobilize
- @root: Return to main

@grassroots
title: Grassroots Fundraising
subtitle: Raise limited funds from voters
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; resources += (dues-1)

We have gained some extra money through grassroots fundraising.

@reconciliation
title: Budget Reconciliation Measure
subtitle: Use Sanders' position as Budget Committee Chair to pass budget legislation.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? If senate_majority = 0 : We do not hold a Senate majority! ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6

We have utilized reconciliation in order to pass our budget.

@mobilize
title: Mobilize the Socialist wing
subtitle: Sanders, as a populist, is very effective at mobilizing the less fortunate to vote for Socialist candidates.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and dsa_split = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if dsa_split = 1 : There's no point in competing with DSA. ?]
on-arrival: socialist_strength += 10; socialist_dissent -= 10; conservative dissent += 5; mainstream_dissent += 2

